@ToanTuDuy_HostAddress = http://localhost:5114

### Đăng ký tài khoản Parent
POST {{ToanTuDuy_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "0987654321",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Parent",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A"
}

### Đăng ký tài khoản Teacher
POST {{ToanTuDuy_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "0987654322",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Teacher",
  "fullName": "Tran Thi B",
  "email": "tranthib@example.com"
}

### Đăng nhập
POST {{ToanTuDuy_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "0987654321",
  "password": "Password123!"
}
